<title>UK: Pentland says intends to sell Woods to Katy.</title>
<headline>Pentland says intends to sell Woods to Katy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sports and leisure clothing specialist Pentland Group Plc said on Monday that it had signed a letter of intent to sell its U.S. unit Woods Industries Inc to Katy Industries Inc.</p>
<p>In a statement, Pentland said the sale of Woods, which makes and distributes electrical products and components, would allow it to concentrate on developing its portfolio of sports and leisure brands.  </p>
<p>Pentland declined to disclose financial details of the planned sale, but said that Woods had annual sales of around $150 million.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
